  "prompt": "For each of products 21 to 40 (product_id from 21 to 40, both included) and each week starting from 6 January to 30 June 2025 (week_start, both days included), show the units sold that week and the 3-week moving average of units: the average of that week and the 2 weeks before it, rounded to 2 decimals. weekly_units holds a row for every product and week, with 0 when nothing sold. Within each product, weeks follow each other by week_start. Only weeks in that range count: a product's first two weeks have fewer than 3 weeks to average, so show their avg_units_3w as missing. Return product_id, week_start, units and avg_units_3w. Any row order is fine.",
